<title>UK: Deutsche unit sets 500 mln mark 5-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche unit sets 500 mln mark 5-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE FINANCE NV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  DEUTSCHE BANK AG (AA1/AAA)</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.875     MATURITY    21.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.545   PAY DATE    21.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0 PCT   REOFFER    99.795    SPREAD	+35 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    25 BP     SELL CONC  1.75 BP   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND OBL 120</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
